sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Trig as Report cron / Rebuild button
    participant Rep as Inbox report agent
    participant Mem as Memory store
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant LLM as Model (REPORT_LLM_PROVIDER)
    participant Gmail as Gmail (IMAP)
    participant F as inbox_report.json

    Trig->>Rep: generate()
    Rep->>Mem: base rules, learned rules, sender facts
    Rep->>DB: triage decisions of the last 14 days
    Rep->>Gmail: thread count, drafts count (recall)
    loop up to MAX_ROUNDS
        Rep->>LLM: skill + memory block, read-only tools bound
        alt tool calls
            LLM-->>Rep: now, search_threads, get_thread, list_drafts, unread_count
            Rep->>Gmail: read
        else wrote without opening a thread (once)
            Rep-->>LLM: insist: open the actionable threads first
        else prose
            LLM-->>Rep: the briefing
        end
    end
    opt answer is JSON or empty
        Rep->>LLM: rewrite as prose, no tools
    end
    Rep->>F: generated_at, counts, rounds, tool_calls, briefing
    Trig-->>Trig: Home tab reads GET /api/report
